 * state, so a minigame is identified by its own {@code id} (a stable slug) and human-readable
 * {@code name}, not by a RuneLite enum. The requirement dimensions mirror quests: items to bring,
 * skill levels, quest points and prerequisite quests (the latter still reference
 * {@code net.runelite.api.Quest} enum-constant names, resolved against the live quest states).
 */
